Global correctness: partial-fifo (run 2).
A first-in-first-out allocation changes the realized and unrealized split
while their sum stays 700 USD.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight unrealized-gains --to 2024-03-31 --format json <<'LEDGER'
commodity USD
  format 1,000.00 USD
  default
commodity FUND
  format 1,000.000 FUND
account Assets:Bank
account Assets:Broker
account Income:CapitalGains

P 2024-01-31 FUND 150 USD
P 2024-03-01 FUND 200 USD

2024-01-01 First purchase
  Assets:Broker  5 FUND {100 USD}
  Assets:Bank  -500 USD

2024-01-02 Second purchase
  Assets:Broker  5 FUND {{1000 USD}}
  Assets:Bank  -1000 USD

2024-02-01 Partial sale with user-selected basis
  Assets:Broker  -4 FUND {{400 USD}} @ 250 USD
  Assets:Bank  1000 USD
  Income:CapitalGains  -600 USD
LEDGER

